{% comment %}
================================================================================
CZ Browse Abandon — Recently Browsed Products Grid
================================================================================
PASTE AS: HTML block in Braze drag-and-drop editor (Browse Abandon canvas steps)
PLACE:    Below the email hero/headline block, above "You May Also Like" recs block

READS: custom_attribute.${recently_browsed_products}
  Written by "CZ - Track Browse Products" webhook canvas.
  Fields used: product_id, product_title, image_url, url (variant_url), quantity_available

INVENTORY FILTERING:
  - Only renders products where quantity_available > 0 (stored at time of view)
  - Aborts the email message if ALL 8 products are out of stock
  - quantity_available is a best-effort check (captured at view time, not real-time)

BEHAVIOR:
  - Up to 8 products, newest first (array stored oldest-first → reversed here)
  - OOS products (quantity_available == 0) are skipped silently
  - Abort fires only when no in-stock products remain
  - Divider logic tracks in-stock count to avoid orphaned rules after last rendered item

MESSAGE_EXTRAS:
  Sets "browsed_product_ids" = comma-separated shopify_product_ids of IN-STOCK
  products shown in this email. Captured in Snowflake:
    BRAZE_BRAZEWEST_BRAZE_RAW_EVENTS_AWS_US_EAST_1_XJ24206
    .DATALAKE_SHARING.USERS_MESSAGES_EMAIL_SEND_SHARED.MESSAGE_EXTRAS
  Use for purchase attribution: join sends → USERS_BEHAVIORS_PURCHASE_SHARED
  on USER_ID within a 7-day window.

BRANDING: The Citizenry — Georgia serif, #1a1a1a text, #e8e3dd divider, #f5f2ee bg
================================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% assign products_all = custom_attribute.${recently_browsed_products} | default: empty %}
{% assign products = products_all | reverse | slice: 0, 8 %}

{% comment %} ── Count in-stock products; abort email if all are OOS ─────────── {% endcomment %}
{% assign in_stock_count = 0 %}
{% for p in products %}
  {% assign p_qty = p.quantity_available | default: 0 | plus: 0 %}
  {% if p_qty > 0 %}{% assign in_stock_count = in_stock_count | plus: 1 %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% if in_stock_count == 0 %}
  {% abort_message('all browsed products out of stock') %}
{% endif %}

{% comment %} ── MESSAGE_EXTRAS: in-stock product IDs only ─────────────────── {% endcomment %}
{% assign browsed_ids = '' %}
{% for product in products %}
  {% assign p_qty = product.quantity_available | default: 0 | plus: 0 %}
  {% if p_qty == 0 %}{% continue %}{% endif %}
  {% if browsed_ids == '' %}
    {% assign browsed_ids = product.product_id | default: '' %}
  {% else %}
    {% assign browsed_ids = browsed_ids | append: ',' | append: product.product_id %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if browsed_ids != blank %}
  {%- message_extras :key "browsed_product_ids" :value "{{ browsed_ids }}" -%}
{% endif %}

<table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 auto;background-color:#ffffff;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:32px 40px 8px;">
      <p style="font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:0.06em;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0;line-height:1.3;">Still thinking about it?</p>
      <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#666666;margin:8px 0 0;line-height:1.5;">The pieces you were admiring are still here.</p>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

{% comment %}
  Render loop: skip OOS products.
  Divider logic uses in_stock_index vs in_stock_count (not forloop.last) because
  forloop.last fires on whichever item is last in the raw array, which may be OOS.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign in_stock_index = 0 %}
{% for product in products %}

{% assign p_qty = product.quantity_available | default: 0 | plus: 0 %}
{% if p_qty == 0 %}{% continue %}{% endif %}

{% assign in_stock_index = in_stock_index | plus: 1 %}
{% assign is_last_in_stock = false %}
{% if in_stock_index == in_stock_count %}{% assign is_last_in_stock = true %}{% endif %}

{% assign img   = product.image_url     | default: '' %}
{% assign url   = product.url           | default: '' %}
{% assign title = product.product_title | default: 'View Product' %}

<table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 auto;background-color:#ffffff;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:16px 40px 0;">
      {% if img != blank %}
      <a href="{{ url }}" target="_blank" style="display:block;text-decoration:none;">
        <img src="{{ img }}" alt="{{ title | escape }}" width="520"
             style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:520px;height:auto;border:0;background-color:#f5f2ee;" />
      </a>
      {% endif %}
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:12px 40px 4px;">
      <p style="font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:0.03em;">{{ title }}</p>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:10px 40px 8px;">
      <a href="{{ url }}" target="_blank"
         style="display:inline-block;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1a1a1a;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;padding-bottom:2px;">
        Shop Now
      </a>
    </td>
  </tr>

  {% unless is_last_in_stock %}
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:0 40px;">
      <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
        <tr><td style="border-top:1px solid #e8e3dd;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
  {% endunless %}
</table>

{% endfor %}

